{
  "headline": "FDA's records show digoxin has been on the shortage list for 65 months as of 2026-10-21; the Hikma Portugal plant tied to one label was classified OAI in 2014 and received a Warning Letter on 2014-10-21, while the Bryant Ranch Prepack plant tied to another label was classified OAI in 2009 and received a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08",
  "headline_cites": ["D11", "E8", "E14", "E17", "E26"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the digoxin shortage has been on FDA's list for 65 months since the original posting on 2021-06-04.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "One labeled product names HIKMA FARMACEUTICA (PORTUGAL), S.A. as the manufacturing plant, which FDA inspected on 2014-03-28 and classified OAI with six observations.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to that Hikma Portugal facility on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another labeled product names Bryant Ranch Prepack as the plant, which FDA inspected on 2009-06-11 and classified OAI with six observations.",
      "cites": ["E27", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to Bryant Ranch Prepack on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Covis Pharma US, Inc. (plant AZURITY), which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 11 days on hand and Corvale General has 15 days on hand at current usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
